NotoSansSC-Regular.ttf and NotoSansSC-Bold.ttf are subsets of Noto Sans SC
version 2.004 (https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/notosanssc,
Copyright 2014-2021 Adobe, with Reserved Font Name 'Source'), licensed under
the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL.txt). They were instanced at weights 400
and 700 and reduced to GB2312, Latin, Greek, punctuation, arrows and math
symbols by scripts/subset-export-font.py. They are embedded only in PDFs the
app exports and are not sold on their own.
